  m_text: "This app demonstrates key features of the Timeflow animation system for
    Unity. To use this app, tap on widgets in the control panel to view details and
    load additional demos. \n\nAll of the animations and dynamic movements in this
    app have been created using Timeflow. The full source to this app is included
    in the examples.\n\nPlease visit the Unity Asset Store to purchase a license
    for Timeflow."
